.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"656\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863850/extras/4d47e06c4b9da7bc7a8a5b4773564c8f.poster.avif?t=1784317230\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863850/extras/4d47e06c4b9da7bc7a8a5b4773564c8f.webm?t=1784317230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863850/extras/4d47e06c4b9da7bc7a8a5b4773564c8f.mp4?t=1784317230\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Moment of reckoning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where luck meets strategy\u2014how high can you score?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"654\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863850/extras/52dd0701ef570d8162c9e57a76c3c747.poster.avif?t=1784317230\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863850/extras/52dd0701ef570d8162c9e57a76c3c747.webm?t=1784317230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863850/extras/52dd0701ef570d8162c9e57a76c3c747.mp4?t=1784317230\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Planning and building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand your Poker cards and Rule Cards based on the current situation, and push beyond your limits.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"654\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863850/extras/f8f92ec2e7125085770412f5907bbab1.poster.avif?t=1784317230\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/